		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Taurian Concordat ended up with the lion's share of the Heavy Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Talos TLS-3T. This refit of the TLS-3G dropped the Gauss Rifle and upgraded the engine from a Light Fusion to an XL Fusion Engine and installed a Heavy Plasma Rifle with three tons of ammunition and an attached targeting computer for extra accuracy. The rest of the 'Mech's loadout was a very conventional five Medium lasers and brace of jump jets for maneuverability.",
